            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marina Maxfield"
            },
            "reviewBody": "NIKI W thanks for the tip using shears / scissors. It’s no fun trying to cube uncooked kingfish with a dull knife. Also do not substitute raspberry vinaigrette for Italian dressing. Gave it a funky taste. And I think I should have cooked it for 5 more minutes. But it wasn’t too bad.",
