            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mindy Newman Van Houten"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved this recipe! I used fresh salsa and marinated the fish in mojo since I didn't have any italian dressing. Also used corn tortillas since that is all I had. Baked about 20 minutes and then finished it under the broiler for a few minutes. Really good!",
            "datePublished": "2013-03-09T17:42:55.743Z"
